ly the personal and health information necessary to run a pharmacy — patient names, contact details, prescription records, and medication history. Every record is collected and stored securely, encrypted in transit, and held in access-controlled cloud storage. Health-related data is treated as confidential at all times."},{icon:yD,tone:"text-sky-600 bg-sky-50 dark:bg-sky-900/30",title:"Use Strictly for Pharmacy Operations",body:"Your data is used strictly for pharmacy operations: patient management, prescription tracking, inventory and stock control, purchase (GRN) processing, billing, and regulatory reporting. It is never used for advertising, profiling, or any purpose unrelated to running the pharmacy."},{icon:R5,tone:"text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-900/30",title:"Financial Transactions & Payment Security",body:"All financial transactions — invoices, discounts, taxes, and purchase totals — are processed and recorded with the highest level of security. Payment details are handled with strict access control, totals are tamper-evident through audit trails, and no card or payment data is ever stored in plain text."},{icon:aZe,tone:"text-violet-600 bg-violet-50 dark:bg-violet-900/30",title:"Credentials & Activity Logs",body:"User accounts are role-based (Developer, Super Admin, Admin, Staff) with least-privilege access. Credentials and activity logs are robustly protected to prevent unauthorized access: every sign-in, edit, approval, and deletion is recorded in a tamper-evident audit log that only authorized roles can view."},{icon:tZe,tone:"text-amber-600 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/30",title:"No Third-Party Sharing Without Consent",body:"CuraTech confirms that no personal, health, or financial data is shared, sold, or disclosed to any third party without your explicit consent — except where disclosure is required by law or pharmacy regulation."},{icon:U$e,tone:"text-teal-600 bg-teal-50 dark:bg-teal-900/30",title:"Storage, Backups & Your Rights",body